# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend — Docker build context exclusions
#
# The frontend Dockerfile (frontend/Dockerfile) does:
#   COPY package*.json ./
#   COPY . .
# We exclude everything that is not needed at build OR runtime.
#
# Do NOT exclude .env.example (kept for parity with the backend).
# Do NOT exclude src/, public/, index.html, vite.config.js, package*.json.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Node ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store

# --- Secrets & local config ---
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
frontend/.env

# --- Tooling & IDE caches ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.eslintcache
.cache
.parcel-cache
.vite

# --- Claude / agent state ---
.claude
.claude/**
frontend/.claude
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE_CONTEXT.md

# --- Build output (rebuilt inside the image; never ship a stale build) ---
dist
dist-ssr
build
coverage
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/coverage

# --- Docs / housekeeping (frontend is JS, no markdown docs ship in container) ---
README.md
**/README.md
LICENSE
**/LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md

# --- Misc dev artefacts ---
*.local
*.tmp
tmp/
tmp/**
uploads/
uploads/**

# --- Test artefacts ---
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.jsx
**/__tests__/**
**/__mocks__/**
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx

# --- ESLint config is dev-only; vite is invoked at runtime so vite.config.js stays ---
.eslintrc*
eslint.config.js
